X: 1
T: Butlers of Glen Avenue, The
C: Anthony Sullivan
N: The tune refers to friends of mine: Maire & the late Johnny Butler. They
N: lived in Glen Avenue, Blackley. Johnny was the leader of The Manchester
N: Ceili Band, who performed at St.Brendan's. Con Moloney was in the band.
N:  -- Sully
R: Jig
L: 1/8
B: Sully's Irish Music Book, Vol.1; Halshaw Music 1979
Z: Paul Kinder (irtrad-l 2000-8-28)
K: G
